            maxDelayMs,
            (baseDelayMs * pow(backoffMultiplier, attempt - 1)).toInt(),
          );
    return _addJitter(base);
  }

  /// Java's connection-error schedule: `200 * 2^(attempt-1)` capped at 5s,
  /// no jitter.
  int connectionDelayMs(int attempt) =>
