  /// waits (`X-RateLimit-Reset`, or a 429 `Retry-After`) — env/property
  /// `RATE_LIMIT_MAX_WAIT_SECONDS`, default
  /// [defaultRateLimitMaxWaitSeconds]. Never capped by [maxDelayMs] and
  /// never aborted.
