  /// `null` when a non-rate-limit `Retry-After` above [maxRetryAfterSeconds]
  /// demands an abort (Java throws IOException).
  int? statusDelayMs(int attempt,
      [Map<String, String> headers = const {}, int statusCode = 0]) {
