///   `BACKOFF_MULTIPLIER` (2.0), `JITTER_FACTOR` (0.3), `ENABLED` (true).
/// - Rate-limit waits (Java PR epam/dm.ai#624, gh-318): `X-RateLimit-Reset`
///   and 429 `Retry-After` are honored up to the configurable
